<title>USA: CME Lean Hogs Index, Pork Belly Weighted Average.</title>
<headline>CME Lean Hogs Index, Pork Belly Weighted Average.</headline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange Lean Hog Index for the two-day period ending Tuesday, May 13   -</p>
<p>    Index			   82.50 up  1.33</p>
<p>    Live Hog equivalent -     61.05</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange fresh pork belly weighted average settlement price for Wednesday, May 14  -</p>
<p>    Price			   79.30 dn  0.11</p>
<p>Note: Wednesday's pork belly weighted average change does not correspond to Tuesday's due to reporting error.</p>
<p>(Source: Chicago Mercantile Exchange))</p>
